  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">q</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>|</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>|</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo></mrow><msqrt><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>r</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>According to question&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">r</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>So <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>",
